  "description": "Experience Freedom with the Bison Pro Urban Cruiser\nDiscover a new way of commuting and adventuring with the Bison Pro Urban Cruiser. This innovative trike empowers you to embrace the outdoors with unmatched comfort and style. Whether you're heading to work, running errands, or exploring your city, the Bison Pro enhances your ride and simplifies your life.\n\nDesigned for all riders, the Bison Pro features a low step-through frame for effortless access. Its long battery life allows for up to 45 miles of range, giving you the confidence to roam further without worrying about power. Plus, with advanced hydraulic brakes, you can enjoy superior stopping power for a safer ride.\n\nKey Highlights:\n\nLong Battery Range: Up to 45 miles, or 65 miles with pedal assist.\n\nEasy Access Design: Low step-through frame for riders over 4 feet tall.\n\nPowerful Hydraulic Brakes: Unmatched stopping power for your safety.\n\nCompact & Foldable: Perfect for city living, easy to transport and store.\n\nIntegrated LED Lighting: Enhance visibility and safety during night rides.\n\nFunctional Front Basket: Convenient storage with a 15 lbs capacity.\n\nEnhance your commuting experience and adventure with the Bison Pro Urban Cruiser. It's not just a trike; it's your ticket to a more liberated lifestyle. Make every ride a joy!",
